    <solution><m>\vec i</m> and <m>\vec j</m>
components of <m>\vec F</m> do not contribute to the flux; only
the <m>\vec k</m> component contributes.
The vector normal to <m>S</m> has a positive <m>\vec k</m> component,
so we need <m>c \lt  0</m>.
There are no conditions on <m>a</m> and <m>b</m>.



</solution>
